<title>ITALY: Italian president receives central bank governor.</title>
<headline>Italian president receives central bank governor.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian President Oscar Luigi Scalfaro received Bank of Italy Governor Antonio Fazio on Friday, the president's office said.</p>
<p>No details of the meeting were disclosed.</p>
<p>Fazio held talks with Prime Minister Romano Prodi on July 15. -- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
</text>
